  "title": "Retain Cursor Position for Each Skill Type [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "カーソル位置をスキルタイプ毎に保持【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "6c4a12ee7c63f6a904d8fda290284bc8b98d703d8830a5cea58d12b88ce56044",
      "translation": "Retain Cursor Position for Each Skill Type [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "6c4a12ee7c63f6a904d8fda290284bc8b98d703d8830a5cea58d12b88ce56044"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ツクールＭＺの標準機能では、魔法の後に必殺技を使用すると、選択していた魔法スキルのカーソル位置の記憶がリセットされてしまいます。",
      "sourceHash": "defb2764fb1dab6000d2a380612b3c96cad64f95205589cca8553f54975ea396",
      "translation": "With RPG Maker MZ's standard functionality, using a special attack after magic resets the remembered cursor position for the selected magic skill.",
      "contextHash": "defb2764fb1dab6000d2a380612b3c96cad64f95205589cca8553f54975ea396"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "当プラグインでは、カーソル位置をスキルタイプ毎に保持することで、魔法や必殺技それぞれに対して、カーソル位置を記憶できるようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "5fad8965c4df3f76a91112196cd23cad33e1e452137f1ef2dc84371b77c8e4ea",
      "translation": "This plugin retains cursor positions for each skill type, allowing the cursor position to be remembered separately for magic and special attacks.",
      "contextHash": "5fad8965c4df3f76a91112196cd23cad33e1e452137f1ef2dc84371b77c8e4ea"
    },
